      "side": 1,
      "message": "Per offline discussion, this is a reland of color expression lifting which is gated by whether we\u0027re using storage buffers.\n\nWe saw failures on Pixel 7 Pros with old Vulkan drivers with color expression lifting, but we consider such failures to be very unlikely given the latest changes, since\n\n  - there are no failures when using storage buffers on these devices,\n  - we shouldn\u0027t ever go back to doing color expression lifting without using storage buffers,\n  - the failures only occurred in extremely specific cases: with native vulkan (not dawn-over-vulkan), in release builds (not debug builds), on pixel 7 pros (not regular pixel 7s or any other pixel phones), and with very old drivers (our bots were failing with vulkan driver version 0x9000000, I wasn\u0027t able to reproduce locally with driver version 0x9801000).",
